    <description>ALF-RS-09 - Notify Cashier from Invoice Summary. The Sales Rep tells the Cashier a specific amount the customer will pay, referencing the Invoice Summary&apos;s own Name (e.g. INVM-00056) as the Salesforce-side reference the Cashier&apos;s reply should quote back. The Cashier processes the payment outside Salesforce and replies with the payment ID, which the rep then enters into Get Payment to pull it in. No Cashier persona/login exists in this org by design - this is the real handoff point between Salesforce and that external process.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Formula_Body</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;A customer is expected to pay &quot; &amp; TEXT({!AmountField}) &amp; &quot; against &quot; &amp; {!Get_InvoiceSummary.Name} &amp; &quot; (&quot; &amp; {!Get_InvoiceSummary.AF_Account__r.Name} &amp; &quot;).\n\nOnce the payment is received and processed, please reply with the payment ID it was recorded under, quoting this reference: &quot; &amp; {!Get_InvoiceSummary.Name} &amp; &quot;, so it can be pulled into Salesforce and matched against this invoice.&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Formula_Subject</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Payment Expected - &quot; &amp; {!Get_InvoiceSummary.Name} &amp; &quot; - &quot; &amp; TEXT({!AmountField})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Invoice Summary Notify Cashier {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
